sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "@drmichaellevin 8-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite — Morphometric validation: 44/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-24"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "What exists now: Law 3's convergence is a real numerical validation against an independent closed form (error 2.5e-5 at N = 240, O(h^2)); Law 1's BVP is checked against its continuum limit (31.51 vs 32.01, 1.6 %); Law 4's slope change is a measured property of the generator, not a regressor swap; Law 6's basin fraction (0 -> 1) and conditioning response (0.0015 -> 1.0) are non-identity outcomes; Delta E = -eta N^2 is labelled an identity; Law 7's Delta CP values are pinned to a hash-verified committed artefact; the Law 2 isolation ratio e^10 and the Law 8 bond fractions were re-derived. Deductions: no measurement is compared with a value measured on an organism, an experiment or a figure in any cited paper - Chvykov 2021's measured enrichment, Pigozzi 2025's conditioning success, Cervera 2020's voltage levels and Pietak 2016's BETSE gradients all exist and none is used (-30); the Law 3 G_gj spread and the Law 8 threshold comparisons remain same-expression checks (-8); the documented outcome values do not match the computed ones (+0.7618 vs +0.1866; 0.0020 -> 0.9036 vs 0.0015 -> 1.0; 0.023 -> 0.909 in the docstring), so the written record of the validation is wrong in three places (-8); the builder still ships no measurements sidecar - the KG payload's `verified_measurements` is a copy of the referee's Pass 3 sidecar describing the superseded code (-6); the CE2 reference is repository-internal (-4)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json L672–L686: verified_measurements m1: 'Referee count - laws whose Python evaluation is ... not fixed by construction', value 3, method text 'Law 1 is the v2 one-point formula with an unused solver' - the referee's Pass 3 sidecar copied verbatim into the regenerated 8-law payload, describing code that no longer exists <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json#L672-L686>",
            "morphoeval/math_kg_loops/levin-youtube-channel-math.yaml L112–L112: Law 6 role: 'CS-only US activation 0.0020 pre-training -> 0.9036 post-training'. Code output: 0.0015 -> 1.0 (summary JSON grn_3node_us_response_cs_only_pre/post; --self-test). Same wrong values in docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md L64 and docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json L583 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/math_kg_loops/levin-youtube-channel-math.yaml#L112-L112>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-catalog-verification-cited-video-ids-resolving-in-the-374-video-catalog-with-sha-256-pin>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-cli-expressivity-model-flags-that-complete-a-self-test-run-with-a-non-default-value>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-bvp-spatial-reach-at-g-gj-1-0-n-100-g-half-0-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-hill-formula-1-n-1-g-g-g-half-at-g-gj-1-0-and-its-residual-against-the-bvp>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-bell-conductance-isolation-ratio-g-60-60-g-10-10-at-v-th-35-v-0-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-healthy-tail-v-mem-bell-gated-vs-ohmic-control-t-80>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-absolute-error-of-c-post-c-ant-vs-exp-dv-v-t-across-n-ap-15-30-60-120-240>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-central-difference-c-post-c-ant-at-dv-40-mv-n-ap-120-g-gj-1-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-spread-of-c-post-c-ant-across-g-gj-in-0-2-0-5-1-0-2-0-5-0-at-n-ap-120>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-c4-breakdown-slope-at-alpha-0-90-with-exit-rates-fixed>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-enrichment-p-ss-r-0-08-p-ss-r-1-25-alpha-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-4-chvykov-low-rattling-fitted-log-log-slope-of-p-ss-vs-r-exit-alpha-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-5-polycomputing-xor-and-or-truth-table-agreement-from-s-a-b>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-6-pigozzi-conditioning-cs-only-steady-us-activation-of-the-3-node-ode-before-after-paired-training>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-6-watson-natural-induction-single-epoch-delta-e-on-the-16-gene-target-eta-0-05>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-6-watson-natural-induction-target-attractor-basin-fraction-before-after-15-hebbian-epochs>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-7-causal-emergence-2-0-s-6-delta-cp-under-the-i-v-macro-swap-dynamics>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-8-multicellular-pd-exact-2d-square-lattice-internal-bond-fraction-m-5-k-25>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-8-multicellular-pd-viability-breakeven-defector-tie-strict-dominance-k-at-b-2-c-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-bib-dois-resolving-via-crossref-with-title-and-author-list-of-record>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-documented-outcome-values-that-disagree-with-the-code-s-output>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-laws-whose-python-evaluation-is-a-dynamical-linear-algebraic-or-combinatorial-computation-whose-asserted-outcome-is-not-fixed-by-construction>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-lean-theorems-binding-at-least-one-universally-quantified-parameter-that-appears-in-the-conclusion>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-referee-count-math-kg-yaml-loci-that-start-at-the-declaration-definition-they-cite-and-lie-within-the-file>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-morphometric-validation-6> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.44"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-catalog-verification-cited-video-ids-resolving-in-the-374-video-catalog-with-sha-256-pin> a schema:PropertyValue,
