    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-cli-expressivity-model-flags-that-complete-a-self-test-run-with-a-non-default-value> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "CLI expressivity - model flags that complete a --self-test run with a non-default value = 13 flags_of_14_tested" ;
        dcterms:description "Closes R7's four aborts; assertions (L833-L850) precede the writes (L885-L889), reproduced: the aborting run leaves no artefact" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Direct single invocations: --n-cells 50, --g-half 0.5, --b 3, --b 1.2, --eta 0.01, --n-states 12, --gamma 2, --n-genes 8, --c 0.5, --v0 2, --v-th=-20, --seed 7, --law 2,4, --n-cells 20 --g-half 1.0 exit 0; --delta-v-mv 0 aborts at L841 (all grid errors 0, strict inequality)" ;
        schema:name "CLI expressivity - model flags that complete a --self-test run with a non-default value" ;
        schema:unitText "flags_of_14_tested" ;
        schema:value "13" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-bvp-spatial-reach-at-g-gj-1-0-n-100-g-half-0-1> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 1 (TAME light cone) - BVP spatial reach at G_gj = 1.0, N = 100, G_half = 0.1 = 32.0099 cells" ;
        dcterms:description "1.6 % discrepancy is the discrete-vs-continuum correction. The user's closure note quoted 31.6228 = sqrt(1000) (the tanh factor omitted); the script reports 31.5097" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "sum_i V_i / V_0 of the 100-cell steady state (script L186-L201); reproduced; G_gj = 0 gives 1.0, G_gj = 0.5 gives 22.8602. Now the law's metric (L718) and asserted quantity (L837-L838)" ;
        schema:name "Law 1 (TAME light cone) - BVP spatial reach at G_gj = 1.0, N = 100, G_half = 0.1" ;
        schema:unitText "cells" ;
        schema:value "32.0099" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-bvp-spatial-reach-at-g-gj-1-0-n-100-g-half-0-1-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-bvp-spatial-reach-at-g-gj-1-0-n-100-g-half-0-1-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Continuum limit of the same diffusion-leak equation, sqrt(G/k) tanh(N sqrt(k/G)) with k = G_half/N = 0.001 (script L210; referee re-derivation of the closed form); no published reach exists in Levin (2019) Front. Psychol. 10:2688 or Levin (2022) Front. Syst. Neurosci. 16:768201" ;
        schema:value "31.5097" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-1-tame-light-cone-hill-formula-1-n-1-g-g-g-half-at-g-gj-1-0-and-its-residual-against-the-bvp> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 1 (TAME light cone) - Hill formula 1 + (N - 1) G/(G + G_half) at G_gj = 1.0, and its residual against the BVP = 91.0 cells" ;
        dcterms:description "Demoted from metric to a reported aside (closes R1); the fitted G_eff and RMS the docstring (L182-L183) and header (L13-L14) promise are not computed and `hill_curve` (L211, L224) is unused" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Script L221; referee: RMS(Hill - PDE) over the 51-point grid = 55.19 cells, max ratio 4.80; least-squares G_eff fit of the Hill form to the PDE curve = 2.26 with RMS 3.05" ;
        schema:name "Law 1 (TAME light cone) - Hill formula 1 + (N - 1) G/(G + G_half) at G_gj = 1.0, and its residual against the BVP" ;
        schema:unitText "cells" ;
        schema:value "91.0" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-bell-conductance-isolation-ratio-g-60-60-g-10-10-at-v-th-35-v-0-5> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 2 (Cervera gap junction) - Bell conductance isolation ratio G(-60,-60) / G(-10,-10) at V_th = -35, V_0 = 5 = 22026.47 dimensionless" ;
        dcterms:description "Exact agreement; verifies the implementation of the published G_ij form, not a measured quantity" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Script output bell_conductance_isolation_ratio; re-derived in closed form: (1 + e^5)^2 / (1 + e^-5)^2 = e^10 = 22026.4658" ;
        schema:name "Law 2 (Cervera gap junction) - Bell conductance isolation ratio G(-60,-60) / G(-10,-10) at V_th = -35, V_0 = 5" ;
        schema:unitText "dimensionless" ;
        schema:value "22026.47" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-bell-conductance-isolation-ratio-g-60-60-g-10-10-at-v-th-35-v-0-5-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-bell-conductance-isolation-ratio-g-60-60-g-10-10-at-v-th-35-v-0-5-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Closed-form identity e^10 from the Bell-Boltzmann expression of Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2020) for G_ij at symmetric V_i = V_j (referee derivation)" ;
        schema:value "22026.4658" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-healthy-tail-v-mem-bell-gated-vs-ohmic-control-t-80> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 2 (Cervera gap junction) - healthy-tail V_mem, Bell-gated vs ohmic control, t = 80 = -60.003 mV" ;
        dcterms:description "Genuine two-regime ODE outcome. Reference is model-internal (the chosen root), not Cervera's reported value" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "RK45 on the 20-cell chain, cells 0-4 clamped at -10 mV (script L231-L277, unchanged since Pass 3); reproduced. Ohmic control tail: -10.0 mV" ;
        schema:name "Law 2 (Cervera gap junction) - healthy-tail V_mem, Bell-gated vs ohmic control, t = 80" ;
        schema:unitText "mV" ;
        schema:value "-60.003" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-healthy-tail-v-mem-bell-gated-vs-ohmic-control-t-80-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-2-cervera-gap-junction-healthy-tail-v-mem-bell-gated-vs-ohmic-control-t-80-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Polarised stable root of the script's own cubic I_ion; Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2020) J. Phys. Chem. Lett. 11:3234 report isolation of depolarised domains qualitatively, no published tail voltage is compared" ;
        schema:value "-60.0" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-absolute-error-of-c-post-c-ant-vs-exp-dv-v-t-across-n-ap-15-30-60-120-240> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - absolute error of c_post / c_ant vs exp(dV/V_T) across N_ap = 15, 30, 60, 120, 240 = 2.5e-05 dimensionless (at N_ap = 240)" ;
        dcterms:description "Genuine convergence check; closes R3. `--delta-v-mv 0` makes all five errors exactly 0 and the strict test at L841 fails" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Script abs_errors_by_grid = [0.007422, 0.001726, 0.000417, 0.000102, 0.000025]; successive ratios 4.30, 4.14, 4.09, 4.08 (referee), consistent with O(h^2)" ;
        schema:name "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - absolute error of c_post / c_ant vs exp(dV/V_T) across N_ap = 15, 30, 60, 120, 240" ;
        schema:unitText "dimensionless (at N_ap = 240)" ;
        schema:value "2.5e-05" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-absolute-error-of-c-post-c-ant-vs-exp-dv-v-t-across-n-ap-15-30-60-120-240-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-absolute-error-of-c-post-c-ant-vs-exp-dv-v-t-across-n-ap-15-30-60-120-240-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Expected error ratio per grid doubling for a second-order scheme (standard numerical-analysis result; referee check of the O(h^2) claim at script L288-L289)" ;
        schema:value "4.0" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-central-difference-c-post-c-ant-at-dv-40-mv-n-ap-120-g-gj-1-0> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - central-difference c_post / c_ant at dV = 40 mV, N_ap = 120, G_gj = 1.0 = 4.699286 dimensionless" ;
        dcterms:description "Agreement is now a convergence result, not a construction: the edge ratio (1 - dv/2)/(1 + dv/2) differs from exp(-dv) at O(dv^3). The user's closure note quoted 0.036 % at N = 120; the script gives 0.00218 % (0.036 % would correspond to N ≈ 30)" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Solve of the Pade(1,1) / central-difference flux-balance BVP (script L293-L309); reproduced; relative error 2.18e-5 (0.00218 %)" ;
        schema:name "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - central-difference c_post / c_ant at dV = 40 mV, N_ap = 120, G_gj = 1.0" ;
        schema:unitText "dimensionless" ;
        schema:value "4.699286" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-central-difference-c-post-c-ant-at-dv-40-mv-n-ap-120-g-gj-1-0-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-central-difference-c-post-c-ant-at-dv-40-mv-n-ap-120-g-gj-1-0-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Boltzmann ratio exp(40 / 25.85) (Pietak & Levin 2016, Front. Bioeng. Biotechnol. 4:55, zero-flux Nernst-Planck condition); re-derived" ;
        schema:value "4.699184" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-3-pietak-levin-nernst-planck-spread-of-c-post-c-ant-across-g-gj-in-0-2-0-5-1-0-2-0-5-0-at-n-ap-120> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - spread of c_post / c_ant across G_gj in {0.2, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0} at N_ap = 120 = 1e-12 dimensionless" ;
        dcterms:description "Still exactly invariant because G_gj multiplies every entry of Q (L301-L302); the invariance is linear algebra, not a result about electrodiffusion" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "max - min of the five ratios (script L315-L317); reproduced" ;
        schema:name "Law 3 (Pietak-Levin Nernst-Planck) - spread of c_post / c_ant across G_gj in {0.2, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 5.0} at N_ap = 120" ;
